<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome To Ediurs Agency</title>
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Great+Vibes&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400..900;1,400..900&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        /* --- GLOBAL STYLES & COLORS --- */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-shadow: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #333333;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* --- NAVIGATION BAR --- */
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 5%;
            background-color: #0b4a4f;
        }
        .logo-text {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 25px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .nav-links a {
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 400;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover {
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        .login-btn {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #ffffff;
            padding: 6px 18px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* --- HERO BANNER --- */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(11, 74, 79, 0.5), rgba(11, 74, 79, 0.5)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519389950473-47ba0277781c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80') no-repeat center center/cover;
            height: 450px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
            font-size: 75px;
            font-weight: 400;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        /* --- INTRO SECTION --- */
        .intro-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .badge-btn {
            background-color: #0b4a4f;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 10px 35px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .intro-text {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #0b4a4f;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        /* --- CONTENT SPLIT SECTION (GRID) --- */
        .content-split {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .left-details h3 {
            color: #0b4a4f;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .left-details p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .right-card {
            background-color: #0b4a4f;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px 20px 2px 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* --- SERVICES TITLE --- */
        .services-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 80px 0 40px 0;
        }
        .services-title h2 {
            font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
            font-size: 55px;
            color: #0b4a4f;
        }

        /* --- SERVICES GRID (RESPONSIVE) --- */
        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 50px;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto 100px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .service-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .service-item img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 220px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .service-item h3 {
            color: #0b4a4f;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .service-item p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* --- FOOTER --- */
        footer {
            background-color: #123e42;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 50px 5% 20px 5%;
        }
        .footer-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .footer-links-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 50px;
        }
        .footer-col h4 {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .footer-col ul {
            list-style: none;
        }
        .footer-col ul li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .footer-col ul li a {
            color: #a0c1c4;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 13px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .footer-col ul li a:hover {
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* --- ROBOT CONTAINER CSS --- */
        #ediurs-chatbot-container {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px; 
            right: 25px;
            z-index: 999999 !important;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-end;
        }
        #robot-speech-bubble {
            background: #0b4a4f;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            border-radius: 18px 18px 2px 18px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            white-space: nowrap;
            animation: fadeOutSequence 6s forwards;
            animation-delay: 3s;
        }
        #robot-trigger {
            width: 65px; 
            height: 65px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        #robot-trigger:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1) translateY(-3px);
        }
        #robot-avatar {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.25));
        }

        @keyframes fadeOutSequence {
            0% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
            100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0); display: none; }
        }

        /* Tawk.to elements hidden setup */
        .tawk-minified, #tawk-chat-container, iframe[name^="tawkChatWidget"] {
            display: none !important;
            visibility: hidden !important;
            opacity: 0 !important;
        }

        /* --- RESPONSIVE MEDIA QUERIES (Phone & Tablet) --- */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links { display: none; } /* Mobile par hamburger menu ya links chhipane ke liye */
            .hero h1 { font-size: 45px; }
            .content-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
            .footer-links-group { flex-direction: column; gap: 30px; }
            #robot-trigger { width: 55px; height: 55px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo-text">EDIURS</div>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="overview.html">Overview</a></li>
            <li><a href="services.html">Services</a></li>
            <li><a href="contact.html">Contact Us</a></li>
            <li><button class="login-btn">Login</button></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Welcome To Ediurs Agency</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-container">
        <div class="badge-btn">Overview</div>
        <p class="intro-text">
            A warm welcome to all business owners, entrepreneurs, and industry professionals to EDIURS Agency.<br>
            We are dedicated to providing a unique and superior experience, empowering your business to grow through innovative ideas and smart, strategic solutions.
        </p>

        <div class="content-split">
            <div class="left-details">
                <div class="badge-btn" style="font-size:16px; padding: 6px 20px;">Our Process</div>
                <p><strong>We combine AI and human intelligence to save your time while ensuring accuracy and safety.</strong></p>
                
                <h3>Why EDIURS Agency?</h3>
