                <h3>Global Infrastructure</h3>
                <p>EDIURS Agency functions on a global scale. Out cloud infrastructure guarantees data security and 24/7 availability.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="right-card">
                <h4>What We Bring to the Table</h4>
                <p style="margin-top: 15px;">If you want to take your business to the next level, you are in the right place. We provide powerful AI-based solutions within 10 professional categories – which are specially designed for your growth. Our focus is not just on quality, but on the best quality and speed.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="services-title">
        <h2>Start Free Trial!</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="AI Support">
            <h3>Multi Language Support & Personal Agent</h3>
            <p>We speak your language. Wherever you are from, we match you with a dedicated personal agent fluent in your language to guide you step by step.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="E-Commerce">
            <h3>E-Commerce & Retail (Sales Focus)</h3>
            <p>AI Specialized Tools for sales funnel optimization, inventory tracking, and revenue growth management.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Business Intelligence">
            <h3>Business & Legal Intelligence (Ethical)</h3>
            <p>AI Intelligence Tools for market research analysis, contract management strategies, and ethical business forecasting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-item">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550751827-4bd374c3f58b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Visual Studio">
            <h3>EDIURS Visual Studio (Design & Utility)</h3>
            <p>AI Creative Services ranging from professional brand identity designs to automated video and visual content output.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div class="logo-text" style="font-size: 32px;">EDIURS</div>
            <div class="footer-links-group">
                <div class="footer-col">
                    <h4>Overview</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="overview.html">Features</a></li>
                        <li><a href="services.html">Services Hierarchy</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-col">
                    <h4>Contact</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="contact.html">Support Desk</a></li>
                        <li><a href="contact.html">Global Offices</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #a0c1c4; border-top: 1px solid #1c565b; padding-top: 20px;">
            &copy; 2026 EDIURS Agency. All Rights Reserved. (Zero Branding Hosting)
        </p>
    </footer>

    <div id="ediurs-chatbot-container">
        <div id="robot-speech-bubble">Hi everyone! 👋</div>
        <div id="robot-trigger" onclick="toggleTawkChat()">
            <img id="robot-avatar" src="https://framerusercontent.com/images/3HBp9bWuNPXdUmznW7zOw3oVp8.png?width=512&height=488" alt="EDIURS Robot">
        </div>
    </div>

    <script type="text/javascript">
    var Tawk_API=Tawk_API||{}, Tawk_LoadStart=new Date();
    
    Tawk_API.onLoad = function(){
        Tawk_API.hideWidget();
    };
    Tawk_API.onChatMinimized = function(){
        Tawk_API.hideWidget();
    };

    (function(){
    var s1=document.createElement("script"),s0=document.getElementsByTagName("script")[0];
    s1.async=true;
    s1.src='https://embed.tawk.to/6a0760b558927f1c34944c43/1jomd3i8e';
    s1.charset='UTF-8';
    s1.setAttribute('crossorigin','*');
    s0.parentNode.insertBefore(s1,s0);
    })();

    function toggleTawkChat() {
        if (window.Tawk_API) {
            if (window.Tawk_API.isChatMaximized()) {
                window.Tawk_API.minimize();
                window.Tawk_API.hideWidget();
            } else {
                window.Tawk_API.showWidget();
                window.Tawk_API.maximize();
            }
        }
    }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
